when a human player leaves the game the game should pause and display an overlay.

the overlay can be in the angular app and should be a darker background overlay with an option to remove the player
and keep playing. computer players do not get to vote. there doesn't need to be a yes or no, just a single button.

if all human players vote to remove the player, the player is removed and the game should resume. if any player tries
to join afterward they should be rejected as normal.

if the previous player joins before all human players vote to remove the player, the player should be added back
into the same position they were and in the same state. then the game should resume.
